--- !u!114 &1028189233
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1028189230}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<#864BAA><Cantaur> </color>We did it, we won the battle!

    <#FFA94D><Titan>
    </color>Unfortunately, the opponent didn''t want to give up right away, it was
    quite difficult.

    <#40C057><Observer> </color>But we won!

    <#4DABF7><Harpy>
    </color>I''m so happy, but it was about time. Thank you for your help!

    <#B92E35>Nautica
    has joined the chat</color>

    <#864BAA><Cantaur> </color>You''re welcome,
    Harpy. Let''s defeat the next monster. I am ready!

    <#864BAA><Titan> </color>We
    cleaned up the area and the path is now clear.

    <#864BAA><Cantaur> </color>I
    defeated the first monster, it was somehow too easy.

    <#4DABF7><Harpy> </color>That''s
    strange.. This looks like a sneaky distraction. The whole village is now surrounded
    by enemies. What should we do?

    <#FFA94D><Titan> </color>We have to think
    of a new tactic. I already have an idea.

    <#B92E35>Laila has joined the chat</color>

    <#40C057><Observer>
    </color>Tell us your idea!

    <#4DABF7><Harpy> </color>We hide in the forest.
    And when the enemy no longer expects us, we attack.

    <#40C057><Observer>
    </color>Oh well, that''s nothing new. But we can try it, why not?

    <#FFA94D><Titan>
    </color>I know we can do it!

    <#B197FC><Cantaur> </color>Together we are
    strong. I''ll go look for a hiding place ...

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 202c1aea27383a74bb3fd8539c1da2ab, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7376050658050364203, guid: 202c1aea27383a74bb3fd8539c1da2ab, type: 2}
